{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2022-04-26 08:00:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON DRIVES INDUSTRY REDUCTION IN PAPER CHECKS AS SUSTAINABILITY GOALS RAMP UP', 'text': "NEW YORK , APRIL 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BNY MELLON — ONE OF THE LARGEST CHECK PROCESSORS IN THE U.S. — IS LEADING EFFORTS TO REDUCE CHECK-BASED PAYMENTS AS SUSTAINABILITY GOALS AND ENVIRONMENTAL CONCERNS TAKE ROOT ACROSS THE GLOBE. TO SUPPORT U.S. CLIENTS' TRANSITION FROM PAPER TO ELECTRONIC TRANSACTIONS, THE BANK IS LEVERAGING A SERIES OF DIGITAL INNOVATIONS AND FINANCIAL BENEFITS."}